      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "From 1936 to 1994, Grumman Aircraft Engineering built the F‑14 Tomcat, the Apollo Lunar Excursion Module, and more in Bethpage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bethpage%2C_New_York",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Old Bethpage Village Restoration, opened in 1970, showcases 18th‑ and 19th‑century buildings and interactive exhibits that bring Long Island’s early history to life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
