      ],
      "source": "https://newyorkspaces.com/old-bethpage-ny-history-parks-and-the-perks-of-suburban-life/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bethpage’s LIRR station began as Jerusalem Station in the early 1850s before being renamed Bethpage, linking the town to rail travel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bethpage%2C_New_York",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In November 2004, the town hosted the first episode of To Catch a Predator, making Bethpage a brief moment in television history.",
